{"2231380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tom Clancy's Ghost Recon® Breakpoint", "steam_appid": 2231380, "required_age": "17", "is_free": false, "dlc": [2231410], "detailed_description": "<h1>Ultimate Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231380/extras/3e78c3a8dc7b139604320891bc32367a.avif?t=1786026109\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231380/extras_big/3e78c3a8dc7b139604320891bc32367a.avif?t=1786026109 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ultimate Edition includes the base game along with the Infiltration Pack, the Year 1 Pass, and the Ultimate Pack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Infiltration Pack: Charlie Tactical Gear Bundle, Overseer Rocket Mk. II Metal Bee, TAC 50 Brown, Mk14 Assault Brown, ASR and SNR Mk. I &amp; Mk 2 Upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Year 1 Pass: Special Operations Forces Pack, Siren's Call mission, Deep State adventure and Red Patriot adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ultimate Pack: Survivor Pack, Sacred Land Pack, Off-Road Pack</p></p><br><h1>Gold Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231380/extras/ca9b98967239931c33a5e141cb0136cf.avif?t=1786026109\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231380/extras_big/ca9b98967239931c33a5e141cb0136cf.avif?t=1786026109 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gold Edition includes the base game along with the Year 1 Pass, containing:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Special Operations Forces Pack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Siren's Call mission</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gameplay content: Deep State adventure and Red Patriot adventure</p></p><br><h1>Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231380/extras/c2e07339dc10b42a82568fa8f2b3dcb4.avif?t=1786026109\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231380/extras_big/c2e07339dc10b42a82568fa8f2b3dcb4.avif?t=1786026109 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Deluxe Edition includes the base game along with the Infiltration Pack, containing:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Charlie Tactical Gear Bundle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Overseer Rocket Mk. II Metal Bee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- TAC 50 Brown</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Mk14 Assault Brown</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- ASR and SNR Mk I &amp; Mk 2 Upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE ON THE MYSTERIOUS ISLAND OF AUROA</h2> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231380/extras/c8b819141743a83cb5316d89bea70c3a.poster.avif?t=1786026109\" width=1170 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231380/extras/c8b819141743a83cb5316d89bea70c3a.webm?t=1786026109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231380/extras/c8b819141743a83cb5316d89bea70c3a.mp4?t=1786026109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Find the best tactic to take down your foes, by piloting drones, attacking and infiltrating enemy bases, and navigating the island's diverse terrain.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PERFECT YOUR GHOST</h2> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231380/extras/c09c945a2a0071ac9b5b9e30dcdda997.poster.avif?t=1786026109\" width=1170 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231380/extras/c09c945a2a0071ac9b5b9e30dcdda997.webm?t=1786026109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231380/extras/c09c945a2a0071ac9b5b9e30dcdda997.mp4?t=1786026109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Create your Ghost from scratch and choose from thousands of different combinations. From stealthy camo suit to bright orange compression shirt, the perfect Ghost is yours to build. Loot, craft, and customize your gear as you progress deep behind enemy lines.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TEAM UP WITH FRIENDS</h2> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231380/extras/78d2616e8f4cab530cf8189a41668993.poster.avif?t=1786026109\" width=1170 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231380/extras/78d2616e8f4cab530cf8189a41668993.webm?t=1786026109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231380/extras/78d2616e8f4cab530cf8189a41668993.mp4?t=1786026109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Experience a diverse set of gameplays with your friends, from main campaign to PvP to rich endgame content. Whichever mode you decide to play, you will always retain the same character. Your skills, weapons, and customizations will follow you all throughout the game like a loyal brother-in-arms.", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE ON THE MYSTERIOUS ISLAND OF AUROA</h2> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231380/extras/c8b819141743a83cb5316d89bea70c3a.poster.avif?t=1786026109\" width=1170 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231380/extras/c8b819141743a83cb5316d89bea70c3a.webm?t=1786026109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231380/extras/c8b819141743a83cb5316d89bea70c3a.mp4?t=1786026109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Find the best tactic to take down your foes, by piloting drones, attacking and infiltrating enemy bases, and navigating the island's diverse terrain.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PERFECT YOUR GHOST</h2> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231380/extras/c09c945a2a0071ac9b5b9e30dcdda997.poster.avif?t=1786026109\" width=1170 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231380/extras/c09c945a2a0071ac9b5b9e30dcdda997.webm?t=1786026109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231380/extras/c09c945a2a0071ac9b5b9e30dcdda997.mp4?t=1786026109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Create your Ghost from scratch and choose from thousands of different combinations. From stealthy camo suit to bright orange compression shirt, the perfect Ghost is yours to build. Loot, craft, and customize your gear as you progress deep behind enemy lines.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TEAM UP WITH FRIENDS</h2> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231380/extras/78d2616e8f4cab530cf8189a41668993.poster.avif?t=1786026109\" width=1170 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231380/extras/78d2616e8f4cab530cf8189a41668993.webm?t=1786026109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231380/extras/78d2616e8f4cab530cf8189a41668993.mp4?t=1786026109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Experience a diverse set of gameplays with your friends, from main campaign to PvP to rich endgame content. Whichever mode you decide to play, you will always retain the same character. Your skills, weapons, and customizations will follow you all throughout the game like a loyal brother-in-arms.", "short_description": "Ghost Recon Breakpoint is a tactical third-person shooter set in a vast open world. You must survive, adapt, and fight a rogue spec ops faction, using stealth, strategy, and high-tech gear in solo or co-op.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Arabic, Czech, Dutch, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Thai, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231380/3e05f31b9aa9fd29b9709f035e73761a908e9fbe/header.jpg?t=1786026109", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231380/c3198d3208113c6ea52ff68f2ccda869a3716f94/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786026109", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231380/c3198d3208113c6ea52ff68f2ccda869a3716f94/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786026109", "website": "https://ghost-recon.ubisoft.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit versions only)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 3 1200 @3.1 GHz, Intel Core i5 4460 @ 3.2 GHz,  or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon R9 28